      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Property Partners Darragh Ó Sé are delighted to bring to the market Apartment G4, Kingscourt, Tralee Co Kerry. This is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-located apartment in Kingscourt, Tralee. Apartment G4 offers comfortable accommodation in a convenient residential setting, making it an ideal choice. The property is situated within easy reach of Tralee town centre, with a wide range of shops, cafés, restaurants, schools, services and leisure amenities close by in Manor West Retail Park. The location also provides convenient access to local transport links and the wider road network. The apartment offers a practical layout with bright, comfortable living accommodation and four ensuite bedrooms. Viewing is highly recommended."
      }
